// Growable vectors are ordinary library code in alloc::vec. That module owns
// Vec<T>, its live Run prefix, vacant spare backing and checked operations.
//
// Core supplies general Run custody and access operations. It does not supply
// an empty Vec carrier, stub methods, a VecAccess provider or a compiler-owned
// vector representation. Allocator loans end when backing is issued; a vector
// retains the owned backing and its allocation obligations instead.
